createOrReplace

	function 'pbi.GetTopCategory' = ```
			
				 	(Category:anyref, SalesColumn:anyref, DateColumn:anyref) 
					=>
				
			    VAR TopCategory =
			        CONCATENATEX(
			            FILTER(
			                VALUES(Category),
			                RANKX(
			                    ALL(Category),
			                    CALCULATE(
			                        SUM(SalesColumn),
			                        KEEPFILTERS(DateColumn)
			                    )
			                ) = 1
			            ),
			            Category,
			            "" 
			        )
			    RETURN TopCategory
			```
